Reason: NotolibraEngine.framework may live outside the host app's bundle (the
plan's downloaded component, §5.7, or a development build in out/Dev); the
Seatbelt profile's BUNDLE_PATH (and, in component builds, COMPONENT_PATH) is
then the framework's folder, so sandboxed children can read their helper,
resources and libraries. Unchanged when the framework is inside the main
bundle (Chrome, content_shell, the app bundle). No upstream bug.

diff --git a/content/browser/sandbox_parameters_mac.mm b/content/browser/sandbox_parameters_mac.mm
